{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02486",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.09,
      "end_seconds": 6.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "hi, you know, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.54,
      "end_seconds": 11.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "no problem at all, come in what's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 12.21,
      "end_seconds": 18.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "Hello, you know, doctor. I'm here with them in case I can help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.74,
      "end_seconds": 24.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 24.79,
      "end_seconds": 30.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "We came because of a hot red swollen big toe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.34,
      "end_seconds": 34.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.07,
      "end_seconds": 40.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "it's been about four days, I'm fairly sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.31,
      "end_seconds": 46.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.07,
      "end_seconds": 70.92,
      "duration_seconds": 23.85,
      "text": "I'd give it a four, out of ten. And pain that woke me, too. As for pain that woke me, a four out of ten, I suppose. I had not being able to wear a shoe before. That's settled now, though"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.01,
      "end_seconds": 77.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.32,
      "end_seconds": 89.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.35,
      "end_seconds": 116.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.8 degrees, pulse 72, pressure 116 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.71,
      "end_seconds": 122.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "now I'm going to do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.73,
      "end_seconds": 125.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.05,
      "end_seconds": 128.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Alright, nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.33,
      "end_seconds": 149.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "the big toe joint is red, hot, swollen and exquisitely tender"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.07,
      "end_seconds": 160.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "You can relax now. Have you had any injury, rash or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.66,
      "end_seconds": 164.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "no, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.73,
      "end_seconds": 169.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.34,
      "end_seconds": 175.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.46,
      "end_seconds": 192.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.0,
      "end_seconds": 198.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, my uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.78,
      "end_seconds": 204.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 205.79,
      "end_seconds": 231.59,
      "duration_seconds": 25.8,
      "text": "she takes febuxostat, 80 milligrams, once a day for the gout. She is on ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning for my blood pressure, I give it to her. It's aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day for my heart, doctor. She takes ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, three times a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.09,
      "end_seconds": 233.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.52,
      "end_seconds": 237.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.02,
      "end_seconds": 240.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.0,
      "end_seconds": 244.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.46,
      "end_seconds": 248.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.05,
      "end_seconds": 254.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.51,
      "end_seconds": 257.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.92,
      "end_seconds": 263.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.5,
      "end_seconds": 270.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.08,
      "end_seconds": 279.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "Gout, for five years. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.97,
      "end_seconds": 280.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.45,
      "end_seconds": 289.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Ah, I've had high blood pressure for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.11,
      "end_seconds": 291.81,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.19,
      "end_seconds": 294.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.64,
      "end_seconds": 306.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.6,
      "text": "right, so gout is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.11,
      "end_seconds": 313.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "let me think, I had part of my thyroid removed years back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.7,
      "end_seconds": 336.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.08,
      "end_seconds": 347.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.92,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.71,
      "end_seconds": 376.68,
      "duration_seconds": 11.97,
      "text": "so, based on the history and the examination, I can't pin this down yet we're looking at an acute gout attack or a septic joint"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.05,
      "end_seconds": 380.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "will it it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.16,
      "end_seconds": 413.29,
      "duration_seconds": 31.13,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with an acute gout attack do well once it's treated properly. I think kidney function tests makes sense here, for gout treatment. I want a uric acid blood test done, that's for gout. Rest the foot, ice it, and drink plenty of water; limit beer and red meat. I'll want another look in two weeks. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.08,
      "end_seconds": 418.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.6,
      "end_seconds": 421.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}